<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Dear {{lead.First Name:default= }},</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">We’re thrilled to share the official agenda for the <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/payment-security-compliance-conference-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Payment Security &amp; Compliance Conference</u></strong></span></a> and it’s packed with insightful sessions, hands-on workshops, and expert-led discussions designed to help you stay ahead in payment security and compliance.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />This event is your chance to connect with peers, explore the latest trends, and gain practical takeaways to strengthen your institution’s approach to fraud prevention, AML, and risk management.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
