<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">Agenda highlights:</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Inspiring <strong>Keynote from Ben Owen, former British Intelligence Officer</strong> and Boss of BAFTA winning Hunted on Channel 4</li> 
<li>Hear from industry experts, including the <strong>PCI Security Standards Council</strong></li> 
<li><strong>Interactive Workshops</strong>: Engage in hands-on sessions covering payment security or AML and fraud</li> 
<li><strong>Self Assessment Questionnaires</strong> - Expected Testing and Evidence</li> 
<li><strong>Payment Security Implementation Programme</strong> - Using Office 365 to simplify compliance</li> 
<li><strong>Student sanctions</strong></li> 
<li><strong>Economic Crime and Corporate Transparency Act 2023</strong></li> 
<li><strong>Case Study</strong> from the University of Leeds</li> 
<li>And so much more…</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">How to book your accommodation</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">If you haven’t yet booked your accommodation, we have a limited number of subsidised rooms available at the Hilton Deansgate Manchester - £99 inc VAT per night, for single occupancy and bed &amp; breakfast. To book, </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://em.flywire.com/MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGSlVmriCO1RhTUkXiC1i1aVrvAWK56zlXxNmIxQ9wa8R9ckgrFmtyNZIvh97UwHSGKmQGirlA=?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>please click here</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #223341;">. Should you wish to stay for 1 night only, please edit your booking by editing the stay button at the top of the page, then click on the date to change the date. Code: AFLY.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">We look forward to seeing you at the conference in June, but in the meantime, we hope you'll join us for the next Payment Security Community Meeting.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
