<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 27px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Payment Security Community Meeting</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Presenter: </strong><span style="color: #223341;">Dave Neild,</span> Lead Security Consultant at Flywire<br /><strong>When:</strong> <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqcu2rpjgvH9BYLSa4NmVqJDS2sHG0Wo_m?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Wednesday 26th March from 10:00-11:00</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join the<a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqcu2rpjgvH9BYLSa4NmVqJDS2sHG0Wo_m?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong> <u>Flywire Payment Security Community Meeting</u></strong></span></a> hosted by Dave Neild, Flywire Lead Security Consultant to hear the latest insights from the Payment Security team. Each meeting will focus on a hot topic. The first meeting in March will examine opportunities to simplify your Payment Security program by outsourcing to compliant Third Party Service Providers acting as a Merchant of Record, with a focus on payment channels for both e-commerce and physical devices.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
