<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 27px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Upcoming Events, Training and Community Meetings</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join us at our upcoming events, training or Community Meetings:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>Conferences:</strong></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Payment Security &amp; Compliance Conference, 17th - 18th of June 2025, Manchester, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/payment-security-compliance-conference-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li>International Payments Summit, 25th November 2025, Birmingham, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/international-payments-summit-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li>Annual Conference &amp; Award Ceremony, 3rd - 4th March 2026, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/annual-conference-awards-ceremony-2026?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Training:</strong></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Payment Security Training, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/trainings/uk/payment-security?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li>AML &amp; Fraud Foundation Training, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/trainings/uk/aml-fraud-foundation?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li>Best Practice Webinars, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/trainings/best-practice?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li>WPM Product Training, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/trainings/uk?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="color: #223341;">Community Meetings:</span></strong></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="color: #223341;">Payment Security Community Meetings. Next one: </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://t.yesware.com/tt/85c45958e1017762e79a259b9435ea0f3f2adf6f/24445c4ec9f45afe39906ad5e6c4a4cf/772468b7ed3dd6b0f8632589c2a862a0/flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqcu2rpjgvH9BYLSa4NmVqJDS2sHG0Wo_m?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>26th March</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><span style="color: #223341;">International Payments Community Meetings (previously called Nigeria Coffee Chat). Next one: </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJckc--rrDgtHN2L_9Ps7DyyprOcJjIR-XlF?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>3rd April</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><span style="color: #223341;">AML Community Meetings (previously called AML Special Interest Group). Next one: </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0pd-qqqjwpH9yVZKSNku1ot8LS2EpW8zXu?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;mkt_tok=MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGX2szJQ-Lw0oqavpz-PsYwoOwKCXbHwD0nQ5mVRjFki69ZXAYbt-gRw7Wn_UnBiibgU3RjMudTw1878Wz-2X0&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>29th April</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><span style="color: #223341;">Tribal Community Meetings - Join Flywire's Tribal Community Meeting hosted by Oliver Mussett, Flywire's Senior Strategic Partner Manager who oversees Flywire's partnership with Tribal, and has recently joined Flywire following eight years working for Tribal. Next one: </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwpfu2qpjMuHNXTNDPIxKE1d2W9fHFOdzlD?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>15th May</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><span style="color: #223341;">All 2025 Community Meetings are listed </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/events/meetings?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
</ul> </td> 
